	annote3 = {Accession Number: 32486127; Dattilo, Benjamin F. 1; Email Address: dattilob{\char64}ipfw.edu Brett, Carlton E. 2 Tsujita, Cameron J. 3 Fairhurst, Robert 4; Affiliation: 1: Department of Geosciences, Indiana University Purdue University Fort Wayne, Fort Wayne, IN 46805-1499, USA 2: H.N. Fisk Laboratory of Sedimentology, Department of Geology, University of Cincinnati, Cincinnati, OH 45221-0013, USA 3: Department of Earth Sciences, The University of Western Ontario, London, ON N6A 5B7, Canada 4: Geoscience Department, University of Nevada Las Vegas, Las Vegas, NV 89154-4010, USA; Source Info: Feb2008, Vol. 45 Issue 2, p243; Subject Term: LIMESTONE; Subject Term: MUDSTONE; Subject Term: SEDIMENTARY rocks; Subject Term: ROCKS; Subject Term: SEDIMENTS (Geology); Subject Term: SEDIMENTARY structures; Subject Term: SEDIMENTATION \& deposition; Subject Term: CINCINNATI (Ohio); Subject Term: OHIO; Number of Pages: 22p; Illustrations: 24 Black and White Photographs, 4 Diagrams, 2 Charts, 2 Graphs, 2 Maps; Document Type: Article},
