	bdsk-url-1 = {http://gsabulletin.gsapubs.org/content/102/9/1309.abstract%20N2%20-%20Five%20U-Pb%20zircon%20and%20four%20Rb-Sr%20whole-rock%20isochron%20dates%20constrain%20the%20ages%20of%20plutonic%20rocks%20and%20their%20subsequent%20history%20within%20the%20Western%20Ethiopian%20Shield.%20The%20U-Pb%20data%20show%20plutonic%20activity%20between%20830%20and%20540%20Ma,%20similar%20to%20the%20time%20span%20established%20for%20the%20Pan-African%20rocks%20of%20the%20Southern%20Red%20Sea%20Hills%20of%20the%20Sudan%20and%20the%20Jeddah%20terrane%20of%20Saudi%20Arabia.%20U-Pb%20zircon%20ages%20of%20828%20+9/-2%20and%20814%20%C2%B1%202%20Ma,%20obtained%20from%20pre-kinematic%20plutons%20of%20the%20Birbir%20Domain,%20date%20the%20time%20of%20their%20emplacement.%20One%20of%20these%20plutons%20(Goma)%20yielded%20a%20whole-rock%20Rb-Sr%20isochron%20date%20of%20759%20%C2%B1%2018%20Ma.%20Granite%20sheets%20within%20the%20high-grade%20Baro%20Domain,%20believed%20to%20be%20anatectic,%20were%20dated%20by%20U-Pb%20at%20783%20+19/-14%20Ma.%20The%20780-760%20Ma%20event%20is%20interpreted%20as%20a%20period%20of%20Pan-African%20regional%20metamorphism%20that%20correlates%20with%20the%20age%20of%20low-grade%20metamorphism%20of%20arc-related%20rocks%20elsewhere%20in%20northeast%20Africa.%20Other%20reset%20Rb-Sr%20whole-rock%20isochrons%20from%20the%20Western%20Ethiopian%20Shield%20that%20cluster%20around%20635%20Ma%20provide%20evidence%20of%20significant%20isotopic%20homogenization,%20probably%20associated%20with%20major%20transcurrent%20movement%20parallel%20to%20a%20plate%20margin.%20A%20U-Pb%20lower-intercept%20age%20of%20582%20+29/-33%20Ma%20from%20Baro%20granite%20sheets%20denotes%20a%20second%20high-grade%20metamorphic%20event%20and%20correlates%20with%20the%20age%20of%20Mozambiquean%20amphibolite-facies%20metamorphism%20in%20northwest%20Kenya.%20Late-%20to%20post-kinematic%20plutons%20at%20571%20+11/-3%20and%20541%20+10/-16%20Ma%20place%20a%20minimum%20age%20limit%20on%20deformation%20and%20metamorphism.}}

